          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/1242.jpg"
        },
        "description": "Mikako&#039;s friend from early childhood who lives next door, also goes to Yazagaku. He has been in love with Mikako for a long time. He searches for his passion and a hobby, eventually becoming an apprentice to Mikako&rsquo;s father and learning to be a photographer. He bears an eerie similarity to Ken Nakagawa, a character from &quot;Tenshi Nanka Ja Nai&rdquo;, who is also the lead singer of the popular band Manbou - often leading to several accounts of rabid fangirls and mistaken identity. He is frequently referred to as a monkey (usually by Mikako). He forms Akindo, a street market shop/club, with Ayumi and the others. He also appears in &quot;Paradise kiss&quot; as Yukari Hayasaka&#039;s photographer.",
